# System Validator (Rule)

Policy harness checks **POL-01** through **POL-05**; companion harness checks **ALG-01** through **ALG-08** (see `version-control/governance/commands/validate-*.md`).

Ensure **full-system gate matrix requirements are aligned with current stage** (default profile maps to **M10** in `scripts/validate-gate.mjs`). When milestone scope shifts, update the matrix and `STAGE_CHECKS` in that script together.

## Frontend + security alignment

UI surfaces must not reintroduce forbidden companion-level tokens checked by **ALG-01** through **ALG-08**.
Security review complements the **algorithm gate**: companion-level and policy-cost docs must stay consistent before promoting builds.

## Full-system domain gates

- **Business Domain Gate**: User/companion/order/review/wallet flows in `backend/server.ts` + `client/`
- **Admin Domain Gate**: Operator workbench + `/api` admin routes + audit trails
- **Production Domain Gate**: Auth boundaries, session hygiene, persistence migrations (see `version-control/governance/commands/architecture-blueprint.md`).
